      "version": 361,
      "versionNonce": 987434409,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1787194725797,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "初始化时的 Ring 状态：\n\nFill Ring (生产者): [0, 1, 2, ..., 2047]  ← 全部填入 Rx 帧地址\nRx Ring (消费者):   []                     ← 空（等待内核填充）\nTx Ring (生产者):   []                     ← 空（等待用户填充）\nComp Ring (消费者): []                     ← 空（等待内核填充）\n\nTx Free Stack: [frame_2048, frame_2049, ..., frame_4095]  ← 所有 Tx 帧可用",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "初始化时的 Ring 状态：\n\nFill Ring (生产者): [0, 1, 2, ..., 2047]  ← 全部填入 Rx 帧地址\nRx Ring (消费者):   []                     ← 空（等待内核填充）\nTx Ring (生产者):   []                     ← 空（等待用户填充）\nComp Ring (消费者): []                     ← 空（等待内核填充）\n\nTx Free Stack: [frame_2048, frame_2049, ..., frame_4095]  ← 所有 Tx 帧可用",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
