      "version": 133,
      "versionNonce": 11187881,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1787194691725,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Step 2: 提交到 Tx Ring (生产者)\n④ 预留 Tx Ring 槽位\n    xsk_ring_prod__reserve(&tx, 1, &idx)\n⑤ 填充描述符\n    d = xsk_ring_prod__tx_desc(&tx, idx)\n    d->addr = addr ← UMEM 中的偏移\n    d->len = len ← 数据长度\n    d->options = 0\n⑥ 提交到 Tx Ring\n    xsk_ring_prod__submit(&tx, 1)\n    Tx Ring 现在包含: [addr, len]",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Step 2: 提交到 Tx Ring (生产者)\n④ 预留 Tx Ring 槽位\n    xsk_ring_prod__reserve(&tx, 1, &idx)\n⑤ 填充描述符\n    d = xsk_ring_prod__tx_desc(&tx, idx)\n    d->addr = addr ← UMEM 中的偏移\n    d->len = len ← 数据长度\n    d->options = 0\n⑥ 提交到 Tx Ring\n    xsk_ring_prod__submit(&tx, 1)\n    Tx Ring 现在包含: [addr, len]",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
