    {
      "id": "H4PSBkSov_zGZwPmNPC2A",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1916.7240243935078,
      "y": 1435.9144727225416,
      "width": 501.55963134765625,
      "height": 225,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b7n",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 282124519,
      "version": 105,
      "versionNonce": 1795629193,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1787194691725,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Step 5: 回收帧 (af_xdp_poll_tx)\n⑪ 从 Completion Ring 查看已完成帧\nnb = xsk_ring_cons__peek(&comp, size, &idx)\n⑫ 读取帧地址\naddr = *xsk_ring_cons__comp_addr(&comp, idx + i)\n⑬ 放回 Tx Free Stack\ntx_free[tx_free_top++] = addr\n⑭ 释放 Completion Ring 槽位\nxsk_ring_cons__release(&comp, nb)",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Step 5: 回收帧 (af_xdp_poll_tx)\n⑪ 从 Completion Ring 查看已完成帧\nnb = xsk_ring_cons__peek(&comp, size, &idx)\n⑫ 读取帧地址\naddr = *xsk_ring_cons__comp_addr(&comp, idx + i)\n⑬ 放回 Tx Free Stack\ntx_free[tx_free_top++] = addr\n⑭ 释放 Completion Ring 槽位\nxsk_ring_cons__release(&comp, nb)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
