    {
      "id": "BTHPG4uLO7zd0kkLraSdL",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2700.62612998724,
      "y": 808.7208788507031,
      "width": 633.9197998046875,
      "height": 400,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b7p",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1865221383,
      "version": 263,
      "versionNonce": 2068871017,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1787194725797,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "发送时的 Ring 状态变化：\n\n初始状态:\nTx Free Stack: [2048, 2049, 2050, ..., 4095]\nTx Ring:       []\nComp Ring:     []\n\n发送一个帧后:\nTx Free Stack: [2049, 2050, 2051, ..., 4095]  ← 2048 被取出\nTx Ring:       [{addr: 2048*4096, len: 100}]\nComp Ring:     []\n\n发送完成回收后:\nTx Free Stack: [2049, 2050, ..., 4095, 2048]  ← 2048 回到栈顶\nTx Ring:       []\nComp Ring:     []",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "发送时的 Ring 状态变化：\n\n初始状态:\nTx Free Stack: [2048, 2049, 2050, ..., 4095]\nTx Ring:       []\nComp Ring:     []\n\n发送一个帧后:\nTx Free Stack: [2049, 2050, 2051, ..., 4095]  ← 2048 被取出\nTx Ring:       [{addr: 2048*4096, len: 100}]\nComp Ring:     []\n\n发送完成回收后:\nTx Free Stack: [2049, 2050, ..., 4095, 2048]  ← 2048 回到栈顶\nTx Ring:       []\nComp Ring:     []",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
