    {
      "id": "apBr4UlPTcPCkwAZ5GMF9",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3857.2033413809877,
      "y": 123.06261129474939,
      "width": 521.859619140625,
      "height": 275,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b7u",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 656070249,
      "version": 59,
      "versionNonce": 1980330759,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1787194790246,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Step 1: XDP 程序处理 (内核态)\n① 解析数据包\n检查是否为 UDP\n检查目标端口是否为 KCP_SYNC_PORT\n② 查找 XSKMAP\nbpf_redirect_map(&xsks_map, queue_idx, XDP_PASS)\n找到 XSK 套接字\n③ 写入 Rx Ring\n从 Fill Ring 获取空闲帧地址\n将数据拷贝到 UMEM（零拷贝）\n在 Rx Ring 中添加描述符",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Step 1: XDP 程序处理 (内核态)\n① 解析数据包\n检查是否为 UDP\n检查目标端口是否为 KCP_SYNC_PORT\n② 查找 XSKMAP\nbpf_redirect_map(&xsks_map, queue_idx, XDP_PASS)\n找到 XSK 套接字\n③ 写入 Rx Ring\n从 Fill Ring 获取空闲帧地址\n将数据拷贝到 UMEM（零拷贝）\n在 Rx Ring 中添加描述符",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
