    {
      "id": "fJHR8XPi4zHEOjzWmK-yF",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3862.7762732083484,
      "y": 529.8854198928792,
      "width": 490.91961669921875,
      "height": 375,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b7x",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 808512777,
      "version": 41,
      "versionNonce": 1928086857,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1787194831852,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Step 2: 应用层接收 (af_xdp_poll_rx)\n④ 查看 Rx Ring\nnb = xsk_ring_cons__peek(&rx, max_frames, &idx)\n发现有 nb 个新数据包\n⑤ 逐个处理数据包\nfor (i = 0; i < nb; i++) {\nd = xsk_ring_cons__rx_desc(&rx, idx + i)\ndata = umem_area + d->addr\ncb(data, d->len, arg) ← 用户回调处理\n}\n⑥ 回收帧到 Fill Ring\n将 d->addr 放回 Fill Ring\n(供内核后续使用)\n⑦ 释放 Rx Ring 槽位\nxsk_ring_cons__release(&rx, nb)",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Step 2: 应用层接收 (af_xdp_poll_rx)\n④ 查看 Rx Ring\nnb = xsk_ring_cons__peek(&rx, max_frames, &idx)\n发现有 nb 个新数据包\n⑤ 逐个处理数据包\nfor (i = 0; i < nb; i++) {\nd = xsk_ring_cons__rx_desc(&rx, idx + i)\ndata = umem_area + d->addr\ncb(data, d->len, arg) ← 用户回调处理\n}\n⑥ 回收帧到 Fill Ring\n将 d->addr 放回 Fill Ring\n(供内核后续使用)\n⑦ 释放 Rx Ring 槽位\nxsk_ring_cons__release(&rx, nb)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
