      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1787194865743,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Step 3: 唤醒内核 (如果需要)\n⑧ 检查 Fill Ring 是否需要唤醒\nif (xsk_ring_prod__needs_wakeup(&fill))\nrecvfrom(fd, NULL, 0, MSG_DONTWAIT, NULL, NULL)\n通知内核: Fill Ring 有可用帧",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Step 3: 唤醒内核 (如果需要)\n⑧ 检查 Fill Ring 是否需要唤醒\nif (xsk_ring_prod__needs_wakeup(&fill))\nrecvfrom(fd, NULL, 0, MSG_DONTWAIT, NULL, NULL)\n通知内核: Fill Ring 有可用帧",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
