    {
      "id": "nCPAi85N_lfTADPdj0DHG",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2684.2372897253695,
      "y": 1326.2817387960317,
      "width": 465.37982177734375,
      "height": 325,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b82",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1680184647,
      "version": 47,
      "versionNonce": 1912716391,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1787194931969,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "接收时的 Ring 状态变化\n初始状态 (已填充 Fill Ring):\nFill Ring: [0, 1, 2, ..., 2047]  ← 所有 Rx 帧可用\nRx Ring:   []                     ← 无数据\nComp Ring: []                     ← 无已完成发送\n\n收到一个包后:\nFill Ring: [1, 2, 3, ..., 2047]  ← 0 被使用\nRx Ring:   [{addr: 0, len: 100}]  ← 有数据待读取\n\n应用读取并回收后:\nFill Ring: [1, 2, 3, ..., 2047, 0]  ← 0 被回收\nRx Ring:   []                        ← 已读取",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "接收时的 Ring 状态变化\n初始状态 (已填充 Fill Ring):\nFill Ring: [0, 1, 2, ..., 2047]  ← 所有 Rx 帧可用\nRx Ring:   []                     ← 无数据\nComp Ring: []                     ← 无已完成发送\n\n收到一个包后:\nFill Ring: [1, 2, 3, ..., 2047]  ← 0 被使用\nRx Ring:   [{addr: 0, len: 100}]  ← 有数据待读取\n\n应用读取并回收后:\nFill Ring: [1, 2, 3, ..., 2047, 0]  ← 0 被回收\nRx Ring:   []                        ← 已读取",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
