      "seed": 15091906,
      "version": 188,
      "versionNonce": 313783746,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1787388074627,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "第1步：批量拼装 ACK                                \n   acklist 中攒的多个 ACK → 打包写入 buffer ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "第1步：批量拼装 ACK                                            \n   acklist 中攒的多个 ACK → 打包写入 buffer ",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "tNq4lKjdtT5BMREDTz6q7",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2328.7131244610564,
      "y": 2678.1429869759104,
      "width": 397.8199462890625,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b9D",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1756598274,
      "version": 128,
      "versionNonce": 569634178,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1787388074627,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "第2步：窗口探测（对端窗口=0时发 WASK）",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "第2步：窗口探测（对端窗口=0时发 WASK）",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "u4cO_9iEE7kBy2LeTSP2Q",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2290.099624468428,
      "y": 2738.6908023170768,
      "width": 663.7998046875,
      "height": 200,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b9E",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1716222686,
      "version": 151,
      "versionNonce": 2111761730,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1787388074627,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "    第3步：snd_queue → snd_buf（窗口控制的核心）                  \n       有效窗口 = min(snd_wnd=256, rmt_wnd, cwnd)             \n       只有窗口范围内的 Segment 才能从 snd_queue 搬到 snd_buf      \n       搬到时分配序列号 sn，初始化 rto/resendts/xmit=0             \n                                                                  \n       snd_queue: [A(sn=10) B(sn=11) C(sn=12)]                  \n                              ↓ 窗口允许3个                         \n       snd_buf:   [A(sn=10) B(sn=11) C(sn=12)]  ← 按sn升序 ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "    第3步：snd_queue → snd_buf（窗口控制的核心）                  \n       有效窗口 = min(snd_wnd=256, rmt_wnd, cwnd)             \n       只有窗口范围内的 Segment 才能从 snd_queue 搬到 snd_buf      \n       搬到时分配序列号 sn，初始化 rto/resendts/xmit=0             \n                                                                  \n       snd_queue: [A(sn=10) B(sn=11) C(sn=12)]                  \n                              ↓ 窗口允许3个                         \n       snd_buf:   [A(sn=10) B(sn=11) C(sn=12)]  ← 按sn升序 ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
