      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b9Y",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2032816770,
      "version": 126,
      "versionNonce": 262929246,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1787388902179,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "如果 cmd == ACK：                                             \n      - 计算 RTT = now - ts                                      \n      - 更新 SRTT / RTO（KCP 用简单的移动平均 + 抖动估算）         \n      - 从 snd_buf 中删除 sn 之前所有已确认的 Segment（free内存）  \n      - 记录 fastack 用于快速重传判定",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "如果 cmd == ACK：                                             \n      - 计算 RTT = now - ts                                      \n      - 更新 SRTT / RTO（KCP 用简单的移动平均 + 抖动估算）         \n      - 从 snd_buf 中删除 sn 之前所有已确认的 Segment（free内存）  \n      - 记录 fastack 用于快速重传判定",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "iEYn-PyKi1qi_cOzy50zD",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3604.5153359533565,
      "y": 3021.163125156324,
      "width": 644.7798461914062,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b9Z",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1376854750,
      "version": 100,
      "versionNonce": 94757186,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1787388908103,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "如果 cmd == PUSH（携带数据）：                                 \n   - 先 push ACK 到 acklist（等 flush 时发）                   \n   - 创建 IKCPSEG，memcpy 拷贝数据到 KCP 内部（第2次拷贝）     \n   - 调用 ikcp_parse_data(seg)",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "如果 cmd == PUSH（携带数据）：                                 \n   - 先 push ACK 到 acklist（等 flush 时发）                   \n   - 创建 IKCPSEG，memcpy 拷贝数据到 KCP 内部（第2次拷贝）     \n   - 调用 ikcp_parse_data(seg)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "kAIQPLlhFCagpdAl6P_0i",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3608.5225221739797,
      "y": 3181.1833304014804,
      "width": 505.35342163482846,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
